Cardinal Weatherhead is a high-ranking member of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], and one of [[Aut]]'s friends there.

[[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] asked the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Inquisition/index|Inquisition]] to pass word of the Party's report to his own friend, Minister [[People/Valerius Vane|Vane]]. Inquisitor [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Inquisition/People/Inquisitor Penitence|Penitence]] refused to carry anything to somebody outside the Inquisition. The two are not the same man: Weatherhead is Aut's friend, Vane is Arctos's.
